OL,3,GNEWSAJeweller fends off would-be ram
OL,4,Araiders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jeweller has told how he helped
OL,7,Fthwart a masked gang who tried to ram
OL,8,Fraid his shop on a busy afternoon.
OL,10,FCCTV footage from within Pakistan
OL,11,FJewellers, on Duckworth Lane in
OL,12,FBradford, showed a reversing car crash
OL,13,Fthrough the front of the premises,
OL,14,Fbefore a group of balaclava-clad men
OL,15,Fbriefly entered the store.
OL,17,FIn the video, terrified customers are
OL,18,Fseen huddling together while staff
OL,19,Fmembers, including owner Mohammed Ali,
OL,20,F20, appear to throw objects in the
OL,21,Fdirection of the gang who then run off.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
