OL,3,GNEWSAJeweller fends off would-be ram
OL,4,Araiders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted West Yorkshire
OL,7,FPolice for comment about the incident,
OL,8,Fwhich happened at about 13:00 BST on
OL,9,FSaturday. No items were stolen.
